1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,730
Empezamos en el sur de Asia,

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:02,630
en la India:

3
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:04,510
el biryani hyderabadi,

4
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:06,010
salado y especiado,

5
00:00:06,060 --> 00:00:08,030
arroz con carne marinada y azafrán,

6
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:09,510
que se sirve con raita.

7
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:11,030
Seguimos al este de Asia,

8
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:11,730
a Japón:

9
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:14,310
el kare, salado y con un toque dulce,

10
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:16,370
un curry espeso que se come sobre arroz

11
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:17,930
con pepinillos encurtidos.

12
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:20,050
Cruzamos el Pacífico hasta México:

13
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:22,050
los camarones al mojo de ajo,

14
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:23,430
salados y dorados,

15
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:25,010
salteados en ajo y manteca,

16
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:26,150
con arroz y limón.

17
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:27,590
Bajamos hasta Perú:

18
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:29,070
los anticuchos de corazón,

19
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:30,610
salados y ahumados,

20
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:32,690
brochetas de corazón de res a la parrilla

21
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:34,090
con papas y choclo.

22
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:35,130
Seguimos al sur,

23
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:35,970
a Argentina:

24
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:37,370
el sándwich de lomo,

25
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:38,850
salado y abundante,

26
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:40,610
con lechuga, tomate y huevo,

27
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:42,110
y papas fritas al lado.

28
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:44,530
Y terminamos al otro lado del Atlántico,

29
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:45,230
en Italia:

30
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:46,710
la pasta 'ncasciata,

31
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:48,090
salada y gratinada,

32
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:50,610
una pasta al horno siciliana con berenjena,

33
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:52,130
salsa de tomate y queso.

